 up. Watch the treeline.", "Easy... easy.", "You're doin' good, Keem.", "Breathe. We're gettin' out of here."]], "nia_shout": ["nia", ["Keem, move!", "Boy, BEHIND you!", "Hurry up!"]], "nia_chat": ["nia", ["Keem, I swear to God.", "Biscuit is fine. Stop asking.", "Can we not die today? Thanks.", "Uh, Keem? One's right there. Right there.", "I'm not crying. You're crying."]], "npc_chat": ["npcm", ["Is anybody out there?", "Lock your doors!", "They're comin' from the river!", "Oh God... oh God.", "Somebody call nine one one!"]], "npcf_chat": ["npcf", ["Has anyone seen my husband?", "Get inside! Get inside!", "Don't let them hear you!", "Oh my God, they're everywhere."]], "npcf_scream": ["npcf", ["Aaaah! No! Nooo!", "Help meee! Please!", "Get it off! Get it off me!"]], "npcm_scream": ["npcm", ["Aaagh! Get it off!", "No! No no no!", "Somebody! Aaah!"]], "keem_kill_x": ["keem", ["Stay the fuck down!", "Eat shit!", "Hell yeah!", "Fuck off!", "Not today, motherfucker!"]], "keem_hurt_x": ["keem", ["Shit!", "Ah, fuck!", "Get the fuck off me!"]], "keem_empty_x": ["keem", ["Empty! Shit!", "Out of ammo, dammit!"]], "keem_boss_x": ["keem", ["That is one big motherfucker!", "Oh, hell no!"]], "keem_reload_x": ["keem", ["Reloading, shit, shit!", "Come on, damn it!"]], "keem_drive_x": ["keem", ["Get the fuck outta the road!", "Holy shit, holy shit!"]], "keem_combat_x": ["keem", ["Come get some, ugly!", "Oh shit, there's more!"]], "keem_scared_x": ["keem", ["Oh, what the fuck...", "Holy shit, man..."]], "marcus_shout_x": ["marcus", ["Behind you, damn it!", "Move your ass, son!", "Hell of a shot!"]], "npcm_help_x": ["npcm", ["Holy shit, run!", "Get the fuck away from me!"]], "npcf_help": ["npcf", ["Help! Somebody help me!", "No! Get off me!", "Please! Help!"]], "npcm_help": ["npcm", ["Run! Just run!", "Help! Help!", "Get away from me!"]]}, "voiced": ["102lizf", "107dkt4", "10eyizd", "10gyfiw", "10sh6kq", "11fl2i7", "11i6w9j", "11itn2c", "11xbat8", "11z1mhg", "1236mx1", "12hvd8p", "12j